#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:6
msgid "# SAP Security"
msgstr "# SAP 安全"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:8
msgid ""
"Current SAP deployment assumes a **trusted local machine**. There is no "
"application-layer authentication on the WebSocket."
msgstr ""
"当前 SAP 部署假定运行在**受信任的本地机器**上。WebSocket 上没有应用层身份验"
"证。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:10
msgid "## Trust boundary"
msgstr "## 信任边界"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph trusted [Trusted local host assumption]\n"
"    Hub[\"Hub anima service :2658\"]\n"
"    SapEndpoint[\"/sap/v1 WebSocket\"]\n"
"    SatA[Satellite pair-programming]\n"
"    SatB[Satellite parlor]\n"
"    Other[Any local process]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser[Browser loopback]\n"
"  Browser --> SatA\n"
"  Browser --> SatB\n"
"  SatA --> SapEndpoint\n"
"  SatB --> SapEndpoint\n"
"  Other -.->|\"no auth today\"| SapEndpoint\n"
"  SapEndpoint --> Hub\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph trusted [Trusted local host assumption]\n"
"    Hub[\"Hub anima service :2658\"]\n"
"    SapEndpoint[\"/sap/v1 WebSocket\"]\n"
"    SatA[Satellite pair-programming]\n"
"    SatB[Satellite parlor]\n"
"    Other[Any local process]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Browser[Browser loopback]\n"
"  Browser --> SatA\n"
"  Browser --> SatB\n"
"  SatA --> SapEndpoint\n"
"  SatB --> SapEndpoint\n"
"  Other -.->|\"no auth today\"| SapEndpoint\n"
"  SapEndpoint --> Hub\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:30
msgid "## Current controls"
msgstr "## 当前控制措施"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Control | Status |\n"
"| ------- | ------ |\n"
"| TLS on SAP | Not required; typical bind is loopback |\n"
"| Token / API key on connect | **None** |\n"
"| Origin check on WebSocket | **None** |\n"
"| Session-scoped tool routing | **Yes** — [strict routing](tools.md) |\n"
"| Credential values in SAP frames | **No** — credentials stay in pass; LLM sees paths only |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 控制项 | 状态 |\n"
"| ------- | ------ |\n"
"| SAP 上的 TLS | 非必需；通常绑定到 loopback |\n"
"| 连接时的 Token / API key | **无** |\n"
"| WebSocket Origin 检查 | **无** |\n"
"| 会话作用域的工具路由 | **有** — [严格路由](tools.md) |\n"
"| SAP 帧中的凭证值 | **无** — 凭证保留在 pass 中；LLM 仅见路径 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:40
msgid ""
"Any process on the host that can reach `ws://127.0.0.1:2658/sap/v1` can:"
msgstr "任何能够访问 `ws://127.0.0.1:2658/sap/v1` 的主机进程都可以："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid "Register tools as any `app_id` / `instance_id`"
msgstr "以任意 `app_id` / `instance_id` 注册工具"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid "Create sessions and send messages through the Hub runtime"
msgstr "通过 Hub 运行时创建会话并发送消息"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:44
msgid "Receive `tool.call` events for registered tools"
msgstr "接收已注册工具的 `tool.call` 事件"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:46
msgid ""
"Operational guidance: bind Hub to loopback; do not expose port 2658 to "
"untrusted networks without additional controls. See [security guide](../"
"guide/security.md)."
msgstr ""
"运维建议：将 Hub 绑定到 loopback；在未添加额外控制措施的情况下，不要将 2658 "
"端口暴露给不可信网络。参见 [安全指南](../guide/security.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:48
msgid "## Protocol hardening (transport layer)"
msgstr "## 协议加固（传输层）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:50
msgid ""
"Invalid frames close the socket with **1003**. Protocol violations (double "
"connect, RPC before handshake) close with **1008**. These are integrity "
"checks, not authentication."
msgstr ""
"无效帧会以 **1003** 关闭套接字。协议违规（重复连接、握手前 RPC）会以 "
"**1008** 关闭。这些是完整性检查，而非身份验证。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:52
msgid "## Future directions (not implemented)"
msgstr "## 未来方向（尚未实现）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:54
msgid ""
"Possible hardening items — not committed; track via GitHub Issues if "
"prioritized:"
msgstr "可能的加固项 — 尚未承诺；若优先处理则通过 GitHub Issues 跟踪："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:59
msgid "Shared secret or mTLS on `/sap/v1`"
msgstr "`/sap/v1` 上的共享密钥或 mTLS"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:59
msgid "Instance attestation tied to managed satellite systemd units"
msgstr "与托管 satellite systemd 单元绑定的实例证明"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:59
msgid "Rate limits on connect and `tool.register`"
msgstr "对 connect 和 `tool.register` 的速率限制"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:59
msgid "Explicit disconnect on missed heartbeats"
msgstr "心跳丢失时显式断开连接"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/security-model.md:61
msgid ""
"When adding auth, preserve backward compatibility only if explicitly "
"requested; this codebase phase accepts breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"添加身份验证时，仅在明确要求时才保持向后兼容；本代码库阶段接受破坏性变更。"

